<title>USA: NSC Corp says CFO Lowell resigns.</title>
<headline>NSC Corp says CFO Lowell resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON, Mass. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>NSC Corp said on Tuesday that its vice president and chief financial officer J. Drennan Lowell will resign on August 7 to pursue personal intersts.</p>
<p>&quot;The company will begin a search to name a replacement, and anticipates completing this process before the end of this year,&quot; said NSC chief executive Victor Barnhart in a statement.</p>
<p>NSC Corp provides asbestos and lead abatement services.</p>
</text>
